  m_text: '[ 3E 3R HEALTH ADVICE ]



    <color=#4CAF50>3E (Healthy Behaviors):</color>

    -
    <b>Eating</b>: Control sugar, fat, and sodium. Eat more vegetables & high-fiber
    food.

    - <b>Exercise</b>: Moderate physical activity at least 30 mins/day
    (150 mins/week).

    - <b>Emotion</b>: Manage stress, maintain positive mindset,
    and ensure 7-8 hrs sleep.



    <color=#FF9800>3R (Risk Reduction):</color>

    -
    <b>Reduce Weight</b>: Maintain healthy BMI (18.5 - 22.9) and waist circumference.

    -
    <b>Reduce Alcohol</b>: Avoid or limit alcohol to protect blood pressure & liver.

    -
    <b>Reduce Smoking</b>: Quit smoking completely to prevent cardiovascular complications.'
